      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAGLESS BRUTE (7) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 2 length win at this track in a handy 34.63. Draws out wide but goes well over this trip. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Can measure up again. SCOTCH ROCKET (8) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a win (29.37) at Rockhampton the start prior. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Must be included in calculations. BLUE ART (4) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (35.03) at this track in a Grade 5/6 over 600m. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Hard to beat again. BAROOGA JIM (2) warrants respect following a recent placing.",
